{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋リハ終わったー\nみんなお疲れさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"27時間テレビ見た！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てない><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男子にしてほしいコーディネート\nってある？マストアイテムとか！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャラチャラしてない\nナチュラルな感じかなぁ？\nストールとか、明るい色の靴とか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは朝強い方？\n俺朝めっちゃ弱いんだけど...\nどうやって起きてる？\n二度寝しない方法とか...orz"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、朝弱いで\n有名なまりかです。っへ\n一分おきに目覚ましならしております\n起きたらすぐ立って動く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか万理華ってなんで\nいっつも前髪割れてんの？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え。\nこれ...割れてるというのか？\nて、いっつも⁈\n前髪はぱっつんだけじゃないぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校で水族館行くんだけど\n水族館に万理華はいる？←\n万理華不足だよ(　・´ｰ・｀)♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幻のしろくまりっくま...\nいつ現れるのだろう⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コラボのＴシャツって\nどんなイメージでデザインしたか\n教えてください☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これって手書きだよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は「Peace」\nをテーマにしました！\n人と人 、みんなが平和に。\n手書きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画館で映画見るときに\n座る席の場所は決まってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見やすいところならどこでも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちにしろお姉ちゃん\nって呼んでもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼んでよいよー^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部活も頑張ります！\nまりっかは陸上競技で\n好きなものある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷わず高跳び"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってメンバーの中やと\n1位なんだもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←\n部活がんばれー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分、スキルアップの為に\n英語教室に通い始めたんだけど、\nまりっかは英語得意？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃまりっかも\nスキルアップのため通うか！←\n英語できんけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Marikaは誰に似てるの？\nﾊﾟﾊﾟさん？ﾏﾏさん？それとも\n寧々ちゃん？赤ちゃん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっと...\nこれはツッコんでいいですか笑\nねね⁈赤ちゃん⁈\nぼかーパパ似です。たぶん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Marikaは何で\nそんなに素敵なんや？\n素敵過ぎるぞぉぉう！\nどない責任取ってくれんねん！ﾊﾊﾊ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照れるぞぉぉう！\n素敵言われて顔真っ赤に\nなったやないかい\nどない責任取ってくれんねん！ぁ\nハハハハ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかオススメの\nピーマンとナスの食べ方は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーマンは...青椒肉絲！\nママがお弁当によく入れてくれる\nおじゃことピーマンを\nしょうゆで炒めたのもすきー！\n揚げナスとか最高に美味しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その揚げナスが生姜に合うのよ～\nどっちも天ぷらにして\nおそばと食べるのも最高よ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょ、熱く語りすぎた。\nオトナでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはアルバイトとか\nしてたことはある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したことない。\nレジうちとか憧れるよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華にファンレター書きたい\nんだけどちゃんと読んでくれるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手元に届くものは\nぜんぶ読んでます。\nわざわざありがとうございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの夏、どんな夏？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザ 乃木充"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか今テスト期間の\n真っ最中なんだけど\nみごとにボロボロなのさ！\nなんでなんよーー(´;ω;`)\nなぐさめのお言葉を下さい(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそやーん！\nもし頑張って勉強したんなら\nうん、テストの問題が悪い！笑うん\nオールはよくないわよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝に勉強しよう！\nがんばれーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BLT×乃木坂46\nコラボTシャツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいよー\n自分の描いたものがTシャツに\nなるなんて...\nこんなことできるんだ！きらきら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは見ましたか⁇\nメンバーみんな個性的よね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなイメージにしたかは\n質問のところ見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手の部分お気に入りです。\n手を繋いでるのと\n手でハートを作ってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が普段から着たいなと...\nだから名前は書きませんでした。\nあ、もし買ったら\nリメイクとかしちゃって\nかわいくしちゃってください♪\nそしたらおしゃれになると思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっ\nうややや\nきもちわるい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼさぼさツインテー...ん\"ん\"っん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近Lessonでこの髪型が多い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなブログに載ってたやつは\nもう、一生しません。\nかなりレアですうぐあぁぁあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩かわいすぎる\n強いぜ... っく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日頑張りまりかよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/3399582/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}